    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/194e780934c4ca7fbdba26223d34a431.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div><br><br>Jack\u2019s simple life ends on his birthday with a surprise. He ends up in an unknown land full of monster girls with a task from the Goddess herself. Will he be able to impress her?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/63865956195f02940ed522197c6fe7b0.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div><br><br>Of course, this quest won\u2019t be simple, but Jack will meet a lot of attractive girls along the way. Will they become just friends or something more? It\u2019s up to you! Duke it out in dynamic real-time combat, solve puzzles, meet girls, and conquer their hearts!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/16b21cea3d19bedeee1f4fc5f24982bc.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 unique H scenes to unlock with more than 913 CG frames and simple, togglable animations<br></li><li>7 cute and gorgeous girls for you to meet and have fun with from a fluffy kitsune to a delicate kitty!<br></li><li>Change how girls look! 20 different dresses, each one with unique visual art.<br></li><li>Dynamic real-time combat instead of a turn-based system.<br></li><li>Several endings based on your choices and your favorite girl.<br></li><li>199 game zones to loot and explore, full of interesting stuff like puzzles and minigames!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/4147b1364fe35eff22938e1b06aec089.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/194e780934c4ca7fbdba26223d34a431.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div><br><br>Jack\u2019s simple life ends on his birthday with a surprise. He ends up in an unknown land full of monster girls with a task from the Goddess herself. Will he be able to impress her?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/63865956195f02940ed522197c6fe7b0.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div><br><br>Of course, this quest won\u2019t be simple, but Jack will meet a lot of attractive girls along the way. Will they become just friends or something more? It\u2019s up to you! Duke it out in dynamic real-time combat, solve puzzles, meet girls, and conquer their hearts!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/16b21cea3d19bedeee1f4fc5f24982bc.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 unique H scenes to unlock with more than 913 CG frames and simple, togglable animations<br></li><li>7 cute and gorgeous girls for you to meet and have fun with from a fluffy kitsune to a delicate kitty!<br></li><li>Change how girls look! 20 different dresses, each one with unique visual art.<br></li><li>Dynamic real-time combat instead of a turn-based system.<br></li><li>Several endings based on your choices and your favorite girl.<br></li><li>199 game zones to loot and explore, full of interesting stuff like puzzles and minigames!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000570/extras/4147b1364fe35eff22938e1b06aec089.avif?t=1698491306\" /></div>",
